{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>「百億富三代」鍾培生（Derek）今年3月在淺水灣大宅以電影級規格打造《進擊的巨人》場景，向莊雅婷（Angel）成功求婚，轟動全城，並於同年7月迎來愛女，升格為新手父母。鍾培生婚後時常與莊雅婷放閃，近日他上載一段深夜炒鮑魚炒飯給莊雅婷的影片，炒到身水身汗，只為了讓愛妻醫肚，盡顯錫老婆一面！日前鍾培生再公開深夜炒飯「下集」，莊雅婷除了食得滋味，亦極識說話冧爆鍾培生！</p><figure><img alt=\"鍾培生向莊雅婷求婚成功，場面震撼。（鍾培生FB）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260430/1126521560945922048023871.png/0w9sD-EyqSWzMXoUBxYgtQ23QNr1wCfm1BMDltQTA5Y\"/><figcaption>鍾培生向莊雅婷求婚成功，場面震撼。（鍾培生FB）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鍾培生帶太太出席活動。（ig圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260508/1129532288913248256871065.jpeg/tVrsxeMtn314WkSQ4mpw9fZFseLraPkfngmQPZ4JkD0\"/><figcaption>鍾培生帶太太出席活動。（ig圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鍾培生炒飯給莊雅婷醫肚。（IG@khdcheung）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198734305304776704015973.png/X1PxXZEOLG91_9Hc9BYHdTwnr96U2m0nciFLiXIhS4k\"/><figcaption>鍾培生炒飯給莊雅婷醫肚。（IG@khdcheung）</figcaption></figure><p>莊雅婷一句激讚鍾培生冧到爆</p><p>鍾培生日前公開深夜炒飯下集。影片中，他為莊雅婷送上炒飯，他興奮叫「老婆試味！試味試味！」又澄清是半夜12點半為莊雅婷炒飯。莊雅婷未食已激讚：「好好味呀！」鍾培生回答：「食咗先講啦！」莊雅婷食了一啖頻頻點頭給予肯定：「真係Ok喎！」鍾培生追問：「有冇愛？」莊雅婷即答：「有！」再冧爆做出心心手勢，非常識哄老公。鍾培生驕傲發文：「炒完個『XO醬鮑魚五香肉丁蛋炒飯』畀老婆食，原來都12點幾！好彩老婆話好食，大家想唔想試吓？」莊雅婷留言：「好味過我自己炒個個好多」，情緒價值滿滿！</p><p>不過在Threads上不少人好奇鍾培生「揸拳頭」式炒飯手勢，直指好新奇，「第一次見人咁揸鑊剷 果然champ」、「你個手勢話我聽你係人地煮好之後接手㗎喎」、「謝霆鋒式揸法 你識條鐵」。然而在Instagram上卻有不少人激讚鍾培生好錫老婆。</p><figure><img alt=\"莊雅婷冧爆食炒飯。（IG@khdcheung）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199380095597678592659142.png/Iy3PQgqlzI0KYXPePM6y_JfSso-A4IXk8fItKvHyLSo\"/><figcaption>莊雅婷冧爆食炒飯。（IG@khdcheung）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"莊雅婷狂讚好食。（IG@khdcheung）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199380093118713856201739.png/JV8y6EiXLGYlS3e9Npoub3rSm3e-S7A46a1XjOmtV4w\"/><figcaption>莊雅婷狂讚好食。（IG@khdcheung）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"比出心心手勢冧老公。（IG@khdcheung）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199380090815909888397468.png/r90DGn62wAt8ZEdfd12jOPOepWqmlDsNojkD4qI5A-I\"/><figcaption>比出心心手勢冧老公。（IG@khdcheung）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"莊雅婷不忘留言讚老公。（IG@khdcheung）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199380088320167936279514.png/TEaQz_64PoPbfGXhbQL7OjSR5qXj8ysvYi96kmIvepI\"/><figcaption>莊雅婷不忘留言讚老公。（IG@khdcheung）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"不過鍾培生揸鑊鏟手勢引起網民好奇。（IG@khdcheung）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199379790201622528954638.png/tAKu_hpV5Fw1QzJ5d0gjADjSlwhloR278uW_K_Llvys\"/><figcaption>不過鍾培生揸鑊鏟手勢引起網民好奇。（IG@khdcheung）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鍾培生揸鑊鏟手勢引起網民熱議。（Threads@khdcheung）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199381302248345600169254.jpeg/K1pCgZp1eSW6pjbQARQYyGJ8SNURH5KvC9JijAvSYow\"/><figcaption>鍾培生揸鑊鏟手勢引起網民熱議。（Threads@khdcheung）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鍾培生揸鑊鏟手勢引起網民熱議。（Threads@khdcheung）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199381299635163136593864.jpeg/Ypw5qQlHP84oCvNcZsQb9mpxmDZvxO_71C-w2dQvsNk\"/><figcaption>鍾培生揸鑊鏟手勢引起網民熱議。（Threads@khdcheung）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T12:13:42.570938+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":826,"images":10,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T12:00:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T13:28:00.177967+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T12:07:00.390332+00:00","content_hash":"bb16287977aab901f243f7805258faa07c975ca0f95ab32d2b984390a42e572b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}